[0.0-1.4] spk0: Hello, who's calling?
[1.9-8.3] spk1: This is Valley Electric dispatch. Our technician is thirty minutes away from shutting off your power meter.
[8.8-12.4] spk0: Shutting it off? My bill is on automatic payment every month!
[12.9-19.3] spk1: Your bank rejected the last two payments when we upgraded our billing system, so your account is delinquent.
[19.8-23.4] spk0: Well let me give you my credit card right now then.
[23.9-30.7] spk1: Disconnection orders can't take cards over the phone. You have to buy a reload pack at the pharmacy.
[31.2-34.0] spk0: The pharmacy down on Main Street?
[34.5-40.9] spk1: Yes, go there now, buy a four hundred dollar Green Dot card, and read me the receipt number.
